;; ── built-in commands ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
;; save · quick-open · search · daily-note · new-file · new-folder · open-keys · reload-keys
;; toggle-repl · focus-repl · toggle-preview · toggle-theme · export-pdf · snippets · calendar
;; agenda-setup · close-tab · next-tab · prev-tab · focus-editor
;; open-file           pick a file from anywhere; asks whether to copy it in or edit it in place
;; copy-into-workspace turn the current ↗ (outside) note into a copy in the workspace
